  "title": "Tuxedoville&#39;s Rhubarb Muffins",
  "description": "Rhubarb can be an abundant producer, and this tasty muffin recipe, made with buttermilk, cinnamon, and raisins, is a great way to use some up quickly.",
  "authors": [
    "Tuxedoville"
  ],
